+          </g>
+          <path fill="url(#grain)" d="M0 0h580v520H0z"/>
+        </svg>
+        <div class="photo-label"><span class="dot"></span><span class="en">YOUR CITY. YOUR PACE.</span></div>
+        <div class="round-stamp"><span class="en">GO OUTSIDE</span><b>去吹风</b><span class="en">RIDE TOGETHER</span></div>
+        <div class="photo-caption"><div><small class="en">THE BEST WAY HOME IS THE LONG WAY.</small><b>晚风，是最好的下班铃。</b></div><span class="coordinates en">EST. 2024 ↗</span></div>
+      </div>
+    </section>
+    <div class="facts" aria-label="俱乐部特色">
+      <div class="fact"><svg class="icon"><use href="#calendar"/></svg><div><strong>每周 2 骑，每月 1 远行</strong><span>让骑行成为生活的小习惯</span></div></div>
+      <div class="fact"><svg class="icon"><use href="#route"/></svg><div><strong>3 种难度，自由选择</strong><span>从第一公里到更远的风景</span></div></div>
+      <div class="fact"><svg class="icon"><use href="#people"/></svg><div><strong>小队出发，全程照应</strong><span>每队 8–15 人，有领骑和收队</span></div></div>
+      <div class="fact"><svg class="icon"><use href="#heart"/></svg><div><strong>没有会费，只有同好</strong><span>餐饮、补给等个人消费自理</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <section id="rides" aria-labelledby="rides-title">
+      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow en">01 / FIND YOUR RIDE</div><h2 id="rides-title">总有一条路，适合现在的你。</h2></div><p>不卷速度，不比装备。<br>先选一个舒服的节奏，剩下的交给沿途风景。</p></div>
+      <div class="routes">
+        <article class="route-card"><div class="route-top"><span class="route-no en">RIDE / 01</span><span class="badge">● 入门 · 轻松骑</span></div><div class="route-body"><h3>下班后的风</h3><div class="route-time"><svg class="icon"><use href="#clock"/></svg>每周三 · 19:30–21:00</div><svg class="route-map" viewBox="0 0 300 90" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 63h300M58 0v90m180-90v90" stroke="#e6e7de" fill="none"/><path d="M20 62h60q20 0 20-19t20-19h48q20 0 20 19t20 19h72" stroke="#859770" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="5 4" fill="none"/><circle cx="20" cy="62" r="5" fill="#859770"/><circle cx="280" cy="62" r="6" fill="#faf9f2" stroke="#859770" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div class="route-stats en"><div><b>15–20</b><small>km</small></div><div><b>12–16</b><small>km/h</small></div><div><b>&lt; 50</b><small>m 爬升</small></div></div><p>河畔绿道 → 江边观景台 → 原点<br>以平路为主，中途休息；第一次参加就选它。</p></div><a class="route-bottom" href="#join" data-route="下班后的风"><span>适合新手 / 城市车、折叠车均可</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
+        <article class="route-card"><div class="route-top"><span class="route-no en">RIDE / 02</span><span class="badge medium">● 进阶 · 探索骑</span></div><div class="route-body"><h3>周末，绕个远</h3><div class="route-time"><svg class="icon"><use href="#clock"/></svg>每周六 · 08:00–11:30</div><svg class="route-map" viewBox="0 0 300 90" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 63h300M58 0v90m180-90v90" stroke="#e6e7de" fill="none"/><path d="M20 65h43l35-38 33 24 34-31 44 42h71" stroke="#ae9259" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="5 4" fill="none"/><circle cx="20" cy="65" r="5" fill="#ae9259"/><circle cx="280" cy="62" r="6" fill="#faf9f2" stroke="#ae9259" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div class="route-stats en"><div><b>35–45</b><small>km</small></div><div><b>18–22</b><small>km/h</small></div><div><b>200</b><small>m 爬升</small></div></div><p>城市公园 → 环湖路 → 街角咖啡店<br>平路加缓坡，设补给点；建议有 20 km 骑行经验。</p></div><a class="route-bottom" href="#join" data-route="周末，绕个远"><span>适合有基础的你 / 公路车、山地车</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
+        <article class="route-card"><div class="route-top"><span class="route-no en">RIDE / 03</span><span class="badge hard">● 挑战 · 去远方</span></div><div class="route-body"><h3>骑到城市之外</h3><div class="route-time"><svg class="icon"><use href="#clock"/></svg>每月最后一个周日 · 07:30–14:00</div><svg class="route-map" viewBox="0 0 300 90" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 63h300M58 0v90m180-90v90" stroke="#e6e7de" fill="none"/><path d="m20 65 35-10 24 9 31-40 26 26 32-36 31 45 31-22 27 24h23" stroke="#c67454" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="5 4" fill="none"/><circle cx="20" cy="65" r="5" fill="#c67454"/><circle cx="280" cy="61" r="6" fill="#faf9f2" stroke="#c67454" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div class="route-stats en"><div><b>60–80</b><small>km</small></div><div><b>22–26</b><small>km/h</small></div><div><b>600</b><small>m 爬升</small></div></div><p>城郊绿道 → 山间缓坡 → 湖畔补给站<br>含连续爬坡，建议有 50 km 以上骑行经验。</p></div><a class="route-bottom" href="#join" data-route="骑到城市之外"><span>适合规律骑行的你 / 公路车、山地车</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
+      </div>
+      <p class="route-note"><svg class="icon"><use href="#info"/></svg>以上为常规活动安排，速度为骑行参考速度，时段包含休息。具体路线、集合点和名额以每期通知为准；遇雨或恶劣天气延期。</p>
+    </section>
+    <section class="join" id="join" aria-labelledby="join-title"><div><div class="eyebrow en">02 / YOUR NEXT ADVENTURE</div><h2 id="join-title">加入的门槛，<br>是一颗想出门的心。</h2><p class="join-copy">带上你的自行车，选好想骑的路线。<br>一个人来，也会有人和你并肩。</p><button class="btn" data-join>填写报名意向 <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span class="step-num en">01</span><h3>选路线，填意向</h3><p>填写称呼、意向路线和骑行经验，保存你的报名意向卡。</p></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num en">02</span><h3>联系领骑确认</h3><p>正式报名需将意向交给组织者，确认名额、活动日期与集合点。</p></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num en">03</span><h3>检查装备，来集合</h3><p>确认成行后，提前 15 分钟到场。一起热身，然后出发。</p></div></div></section>
+    <aside class="essentials"><div><h3>出发前，记得这几件小事。</h3><p>遵守交通规则，量力而行。我们一起出发，也一起平安回来。</p></div><div class="gear"><span><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg>自备自行车与头盔</span><span><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg>夜骑装好前后灯</span><span><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg>带足饮水与补给</span></div></aside>
+  </main>
+  <footer class="wrap"><a class="footer-brand" href="#">街外 <span class="en">OUTSIDE®</span></a><p>城市骑行俱乐部招新页面示例 · 活动与路线为示例安排<br>报名表仅在本机保存意向，正式上线需接入报名服务并补充组织者联系方式。</p><a href="#" class="en">SEE YOU OUTSIDE. ↑</a></footer>
+  <dialog id="signup" aria-labelledby="signup-title"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="signup-title">下一程，一起骑。</h2><button class="close" type="button" aria-label="关闭报名表">×</button></div><p class="form-intro">选一条喜欢的路线，留下你的骑行计划。<br>本页为演示，保存意向不代表已获得活动名额。</p><form id="signup-form"><label for="rider-name">怎么称呼你</label><input id="rider-name" name="name" required maxlength="30" autocomplete="nickname" placeholder="你的名字或昵称"><label for="ride-choice">想参加哪一场</label><select id="ride-choice" name="route"><option>下班后的风</option><option>周末，绕个远</option><option>骑到城市之外</option></select><label for="experience">你的骑行经验</label><select id="experience" name="experience"><option>刚刚开始，想试试集体骑行</option><option>偶尔骑行，可以完成 20–40 km</option><option>规律骑行，有 50 km 以上经验</option></select><p class="form-note">信息仅保存在当前浏览器，不会发送至俱乐部。实际报名需由组织者确认；本示例暂未配置组织者联系方式。</p><button class="btn submit" type="submit">保存我的骑行意向 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><div class="form-result" id="form-result" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></form></dialog>
+  <script>
+    const dialog = document.getElementById('signup');
+    const form = document.getElementById('signup-form');
+    const result = document.getElementById('form-result');
+    const choice = document.getElementById('ride-choice');
+    function openSignup(route) {
+      result.textContent = '';
+      try {
+        const saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('outside-ride-intent') || 'null');
+        if (saved && typeof saved.name === 'string') {
+          form.elements.name.value = saved.name;
+          if ([...choice.options].some(o => o.value === saved.route)) choice.value = saved.route;
+          if ([...form.elements.experience.options].some(o => o.value === saved.experience)) form.elements.experience.value = saved.experience;
+        }
+      } catch (_) {}
+      if (route) choice.value = route;
+      dialog.showModal();
+    }
+    document.querySelectorAll('[data-join]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => openSignup()));
+    document.querySelectorAll('[data-route]').forEach(link => link.addEventListener('click', event => {event.preventDefault(); openSignup(link.dataset.route);}));
+    document.querySelector('.close').addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
+    dialog.addEventListener('click', event => {
+      const bounds = dialog.getBoundingClientRect();
+      if (event.target === dialog && (event.clientX < bounds.left || event.clientX > bounds.right || event.clientY < bounds.top || event.clientY > bounds.bottom)) dialog.close();
+    });
+    form.addEventListener('submit', event => {
+      event.preventDefault();
+      const name = form.elements.name.value.trim();
+      if (!name) {form.elements.name.setCustomValidity('请填写名字或昵称'); form.elements.name.reportValidity(); return;}
+      const intent = {name, route: choice.value, experience: form.elements.experience.value};
+      try {
+        localStorage.setItem('outside-ride-intent', JSON.stringify(intent));
+        result.textContent = `${name}，你的「${intent.route}」骑行意向已保存在此浏览器。尚未提交报名，请待组织者开放正式报名渠道后确认名额与集合信息。`;
+      } catch (_) {
+        result.textContent = `当前浏览器无法保存数据。请记下你的骑行意向：${name} · ${intent.route} · ${intent.experience}。此信息尚未提交报名。`;
+      }
+    });
+    form.elements.name.addEventListener('input', () => form.elements.name.setCustomValidity(''));
+  </script>
+</body>
+</html>

