+    <section id="rides" aria-labelledby="rides-title">
+      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow en">01 / FIND YOUR RIDE</div><h2 id="rides-title">总有一条路，适合现在的你。</h2></div><p>不卷速度，不比装备。<br>先选一个舒服的节奏，剩下的交给沿途风景。</p></div>
+      <div class="routes">
+        <article class="route-card"><div class="route-top"><span class="route-no en">RIDE / 01</span><span class="badge">● 入门 · 轻松骑</span></div><div class="route-body"><h3>下班后的风</h3><div class="route-time"><svg class="icon"><use href="#clock"/></svg>每周三 · 19:30–21:00</div><svg class="route-map" viewBox="0 0 300 90" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 63h300M58 0v90m180-90v90" stroke="#e6e7de" fill="none"/><path d="M20 62h60q20 0 20-19t20-19h48q20 0 20 19t20 19h72" stroke="#859770" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="5 4" fill="none"/><circle cx="20" cy="62" r="5" fill="#859770"/><circle cx="280" cy="62" r="6" fill="#faf9f2" stroke="#859770" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div class="route-stats en"><div><b>15–20</b><small>km</small></div><div><b>12–16</b><small>km/h</small></div><div><b>&lt; 50</b><small>m 爬升</small></div></div><p>河畔绿道 → 江边观景台 → 原点<br>以平路为主，中途休息；第一次参加就选它。</p></div><a class="route-bottom" href="#join" data-route="下班后的风"><span>适合新手 / 城市车、折叠车均可</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
+        <article class="route-card"><div class="route-top"><span class="route-no en">RIDE / 02</span><span class="badge medium">● 进阶 · 探索骑</span></div><div class="route-body"><h3>周末，绕个远</h3><div class="route-time"><svg class="icon"><use href="#clock"/></svg>每周六 · 08:00–11:30</div><svg class="route-map" viewBox="0 0 300 90" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 63h300M58 0v90m180-90v90" stroke="#e6e7de" fill="none"/><path d="M20 65h43l35-38 33 24 34-31 44 42h71" stroke="#ae9259" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="5 4" fill="none"/><circle cx="20" cy="65" r="5" fill="#ae9259"/><circle cx="280" cy="62" r="6" fill="#faf9f2" stroke="#ae9259" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div class="route-stats en"><div><b>35–45</b><small>km</small></div><div><b>18–22</b><small>km/h</small></div><div><b>200</b><small>m 爬升</small></div></div><p>城市公园 → 环湖路 → 街角咖啡店<br>平路加缓坡，设补给点；建议有 20 km 骑行经验。</p></div><a class="route-bottom" href="#join" data-route="周末，绕个远"><span>适合有基础的你 / 公路车、山地车</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
